#ASSERT `Can I still make my 48-hour application` `au` FALSE TRUE (`d` 10 3 2026) 14 30 (`d` 10 3 2026) 14 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I still make my 48-hour application` `au` TRUE FALSE (`d` 10 3 2026) 14 30 (`d` 11 3 2026) 9 0 EQUALS NOTHING
