#ASSERT `What happens to my item the police took` FALSE (`d` 10 3 2026) TRUE (`d` 1 12 2026) FALSE (`d` 1 9 2026) EQUALS `the police may keep it until an investigation begins or 12 months pass`

§§ `Penalties`

#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined in penalty units` `not reporting a reportable death (s 19)` EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined in penalty units` `not giving the coroner information after reporting a death (s 20(1))` EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined in penalty units` `entering or interfering with a restricted death scene (s 34(3))` EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined in penalty units` `not giving the coroner information after asking for a fire investigation (s 42(3))` EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined in penalty units` `entering or interfering with a restricted fire or explosion scene (s 49(3))` EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined in penalty units` `disobeying a coroner's summons, order or direction without reasonable excuse (s 53(4))` EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined in penalty units` `publishing a report contrary to a coroner's order (s 57(2))` EQUALS 50
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined in penalty units` `publishing a released coronial record contrary to an order (s 58C(9))` EQUALS 50
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined in penalty units` `hindering or obstructing a coroner (s 65)` EQUALS 20
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined in penalty units` `insulting a coroner, interrupting an inquest or causing a disturbance (s 66)` EQUALS 50
#ASSERT `What is the longest I can be imprisoned in months` `not reporting a reportable death (s 19)` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `What is the longest I can be imprisoned in months` `entering or interfering with a restricted death scene (s 34(3))` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `What is the longest I can be imprisoned in months` `entering or interfering with a restricted fire or explosion scene (s 49(3))` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `What is the longest I can be imprisoned in months` `disobeying a coroner's summons, order or direction without reasonable excuse (s 53(4))` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `What is the longest I can be imprisoned in months` `publishing a report contrary to a coroner's order (s 57(2))` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `What is the longest I can be imprisoned in months` `hindering or obstructing a coroner (s 65)` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `What is the longest I can be imprisoned in months` `insulting a coroner, interrupting an inquest or causing a disturbance (s 66)` EQUALS 6

§§ `The regulative rules directly`

-- MUST within 14: day 14 in time, day 15 not.
#ASSERT `taking the step at` 14 `satisfies` (`the step must be taken within` 14)
#ASSERT (NOT (`taking the step at` 15 `satisfies` (`the step must be taken within` 14)))
-- SHANT for 2879 minutes: at 2879 a breach, at 2880 not.
#ASSERT `the 48-hour bar is broken by acting at` 2879
#ASSERT (NOT (`the 48-hour bar is broken by acting at` 2880))
#ASSERT `the 48-hour bar is broken by acting at` (0 MINUS 5)
